  "description": "A Result pattern library for .NET with typed errors, Railway-Oriented pipelines, and automatic flow diagrams generated from your code. Provides Result<T>, Result<T,TError>, ErrorsOf<T1..T8>, rich domain errors (ValidationError, ForbiddenError, NotFoundError, ConflictError) with TagKey<T> metadata, ResultContext for entity/correlation/tenant tracking, and full async pipeline support via Bind, Map, Ensure, Tap. Companion packages add pipeline visualization, ASP.NET Core, FluentValidation, OpenTelemetry, HTTP integration, and Roslyn safety analyzers.",
